From 2a3f5c232a1df0baef36f67c1f8966dd62d01359 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 00:26:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Make LedgerLens deployable on Vercel

- vercel.json: build the Vite UI as static files and serve the Flask API from api/index.py under /api
- Drop the Bolt-only rollup override that makes npm install fail (EOVERRIDE)
- API client uses same-origin /api in production, localhost:8080 in dev
- Call Gemini/OpenAI over REST instead of SDKs to keep the function bundle small

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015PQebj9M2qcotUboXsb4tY
